---
// Hero — editorial masthead: hairline metadata row, oversized asymmetric
// display type, proof prose in an offset two-column base. The cursor-revealed
// binary rain stays as the interactive signature, now behind giant glyphs.
// Copy is Gabriel's approved text, verbatim (F6 gate) — only the composition changed.
---

<header class="hero" id="top" data-hero>
  <canvas class="hero-rain" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
  <span class="reg tl"></span>
  <span class="reg tr"></span>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="hero-mast mono">
      <span class="i18n" data-en="Design engineer" data-pt="Design engineer">Design engineer</span>
      <span class="hero-mast-mid i18n" data-en="Portfolio — 2026" data-pt="Portfólio — 2026">Portfolio — 2026</span>
      <span class="hero-mast-right">
        <span>SÃO PAULO, BR</span>
        <span class="sep" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <time id="clock" aria-label="Local time in São Paulo">--:--:--</time>
      </span>
    </div>

    <h1
      class="i18n"
      data-en="I design and build <em>web products.</em>"
      data-pt="Eu projeto e construo <em>produtos web.</em>"
    >
      I design and build <em>web products.</em>
    </h1>

    <div class="hero-base">
      <p
        class="hero-lede i18n"
        data-en="I'm Gabriel Andrade, a <b>design engineer</b> from São Paulo. For five years I've carried interfaces from the Figma file to production — <b>1,000+ screens</b>, <b>200+ product flows</b>, and a <b>design system built from scratch</b> — caring in equal measure about how a product feels and how it's built."
        data-pt="Sou Gabriel Andrade, <b>design engineer</b> de São Paulo. Há cinco anos levo interfaces do arquivo no Figma até a produção — <b>1.000+ telas</b>, <b>200+ fluxos de produto</b> e um <b>design system feito do zero</b> — me importando na mesma medida com como um produto se sente e como ele é feito."
      >
        I'm Gabriel Andrade, a <b>design engineer</b> from São Paulo. For five years I've carried
        interfaces from the Figma file to production — <b>1,000+ screens</b>, <b>200+ product flows</b>,
        and a <b>design system built from scratch</b> — caring in equal measure about how a product
        feels and how it's built.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-aside">
        <p
          class="hero-sub i18n"
          data-en="These days I build in React, TypeScript, and Tailwind, lean on AI-assisted workflows for research and planning, and document the decisions along the way."
          data-pt="Hoje construo em React, TypeScript e Tailwind, me apoio em workflows com IA para pesquisa e planejamento, e documento as decisões pelo caminho."
        >
          These days I build in React, TypeScript, and Tailwind, lean on AI-assisted workflows for
          research and planning, and document the decisions along the way.
        </p>
        <a class="hero-cue mono" href="/#work">
          <span class="i18n" data-en="Selected work" data-pt="Trabalhos selecionados">Selected work</span>
          <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>
